{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_title", "source_sha256": "a680f5c2826f2c23459b2ae61a86c8f39cbf18a63c11261c6666b60a3627053f", "ja": "麗花とおでかけ2", "zh": "和丽花一起出游2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a03ca340c0d3cc326a72b065e7b7b15088289b44d7b151758e4c8c5bade03b35", "ja": "麗花とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "与丽花一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a49a62354dd24f36120612f082b0d61c985b6f0f8f2bd8ff79744098718527b", "ja": "（麗花が眼鏡を作りたいというので、眼鏡産業で\n有名な鯖江市に来た。色々な眼鏡があるな……）", "zh": "（丽花说想配一副眼镜，所以我们来到了以眼镜产业闻名的鲭江市。这里有各种各样的眼镜啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "7ed15607bb6312b2db9725463983e30bd960ec0888044c4c65553a396c696e9d", "ja": "これとか……このフレームも素敵ですね！\nあっ、こっちもいいな♪", "zh": "像这个……这个镜框也很漂亮呢！\n啊，这边这个也不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5d5d18ab54f7f7a19adbd6159e512d2b0e35336330c67a893e10e8a24b3770dc", "ja": "洗練されたデザインだな。\nこれなんかも、似合うんじゃないか？", "zh": "设计真精致。\n这个也很适合你吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "168e9a8942ae85ebbd8bc82406ef1724022b5306a5c8970cd7268c4453810fb6", "ja": "なるほどー。でも私的には、\nもっと普通なほうがいいんですよねー。", "zh": "原来如此——不过对我来说，还是普通一点的比较好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c7b1707c5029d9074c540fa0b6e361e03f7c3f50afdf28a6756b54c3644d647b", "ja": "そうか。でも麗花もアイドルだし、変装用とはいえ\nこういうオシャレな眼鏡でもいいと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "这样啊。不过丽花也是偶像，我觉得即使是用来变装，戴这种时髦的眼镜也挺好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "dee95c3ab2ed6b4df4be9f6b7c8065b06baa29e154e4a7ac37895f6d6523909f", "ja": "え？　今日は、{$P$}さんの\n眼鏡を選びに来たんですよ？", "zh": "咦？今天不是来给{$P$}先生挑眼镜的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "334a426a0cd322d33e8ae2bf2ace89687bf32cf889bc15c3cf8316974bcb8f57", "ja": "えっ……俺の？", "zh": "诶……我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "b555f5f2bfe12f744d457a3fab7fbdeadcdc19a1df62a7fe125eb9c9ce91ecde", "ja": "最近、目が疲れるって言ってたから。\nPCやスマホを使う時用に、と思って♪", "zh": "你最近说眼睛容易疲劳嘛。\n就想着买一副用来对着电脑和手机时戴的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "746cd0ad3a2586eb1aec599a3fdb460612cb8cde009c746e108b6c5f10798cab", "ja": "はい、これかけてみてください！\n……うわぁー！　すっごく、普通の人ですね♪", "zh": "来，试试看戴上这个！\n……哇——！看起来简直就是个普通人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "b6615fb15cdabff3dc293663979b97bf8559efc317c68efa162d0c2d1472bacf", "ja": "いつも思ってたんだけど……それって、褒めてるのか？\nなあ、そうだよな……？", "zh": "我一直在想……你那是在夸我吗？\n喂，是在夸我吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "3411262a24a243da223da5555f50e820e6a130fad9c969c2362912c76113a163", "ja": "すみませーん！　これください！　あっ、レンズは\n光をカットしてくれるのでお願いします♪", "zh": "不好意思——！我要这个！啊，镜片要选能阻挡光线的那种，拜托了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_048rei02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_048rei02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "de73a17459b41213375e4a615172a47d536f3977bbb6983b5f54ebda0a231c08", "ja": "（麗花の返事はなかったけど、選んでもらった\n眼鏡は恐ろしく似合った……結果オーライ、かな？）", "zh": "（虽然丽花没有回复，但让她挑的眼镜竟然合适得不得了……也算是歪打正着吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
